+# R58 Execution — Landed-vs-Rejected Reconciliation Sweep (2026-10-29)
+
+> Executes the R58 scout filing [#2275](https://github.com/Supremeai-bd/supremeai-open/issues/2275) (option-A preparation). Report-only: zero production writes, zero code edits. Contributor cycle 27 (Job 478338, dispatch 05:35+08), zero-credential Tower vantage + local full-history git. Claim: atomic `work_claim` 21:37:49Z (dual-plane label+comment).
